    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/f3b1104e6d923fa5e04d67cb0b8a0b8b.poster.avif?t=1754834036\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/f3b1104e6d923fa5e04d67cb0b8a0b8b.webm?t=1754834036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/f3b1104e6d923fa5e04d67cb0b8a0b8b.mp4?t=1754834036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The end of the universe. Humanity has disappeared, and the stars have gone out. However, humanity was able to leave something behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The World of Ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is relative in this world, and in the great void, ideas begin to materialize. As one of the self-aware ideas, you strive for the ultimate materialization of the world of ideas, but the battle for it will not be easy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/2fb22d5d5d344b4847cb512a78f89efd.poster.avif?t=1754834036\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/2fb22d5d5d344b4847cb512a78f89efd.webm?t=1754834036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/2fb22d5d5d344b4847cb512a78f89efd.mp4?t=1754834036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Tactics is a turn-based tactical roguelike inspired by games like Kings Bounty and Into the Breach. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a unique squad of creatures with their own strengths and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in deep tactical battles with the impact of landscape on combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine creatures to create stronger ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a variety of spells that can turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find &quot;Ideas&quot; with their unique effects.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/e4673c700e59350c744c182cac2006f0.poster.avif?t=1754834036\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/e4673c700e59350c744c182cac2006f0.webm?t=1754834036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/e4673c700e59350c744c182cac2006f0.mp4?t=1754834036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability - procedural generation and a vast amount of content (Over 200 creatures, 120+ spells, and around 300 &quot;Ideas&quot;) make each run unique. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of unlockable content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitch integration, allowing interaction with the chat.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/a27a6c17a0503e0eac4299fad532a84e.poster.avif?t=1754834036\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/a27a6c17a0503e0eac4299fad532a84e.webm?t=1754834036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/a27a6c17a0503e0eac4299fad532a84e.mp4?t=1754834036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/f3b1104e6d923fa5e04d67cb0b8a0b8b.poster.avif?t=1754834036\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/f3b1104e6d923fa5e04d67cb0b8a0b8b.webm?t=1754834036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/f3b1104e6d923fa5e04d67cb0b8a0b8b.mp4?t=1754834036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The end of the universe. Humanity has disappeared, and the stars have gone out. However, humanity was able to leave something behind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The World of Ideas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Everything is relative in this world, and in the great void, ideas begin to materialize. As one of the self-aware ideas, you strive for the ultimate materialization of the world of ideas, but the battle for it will not be easy. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/2fb22d5d5d344b4847cb512a78f89efd.poster.avif?t=1754834036\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/2fb22d5d5d344b4847cb512a78f89efd.webm?t=1754834036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/2fb22d5d5d344b4847cb512a78f89efd.mp4?t=1754834036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rogue Tactics is a turn-based tactical roguelike inspired by games like Kings Bounty and Into the Breach. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a unique squad of creatures with their own strengths and weaknesses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight in deep tactical battles with the impact of landscape on combat.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combine creatures to create stronger ones.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect a variety of spells that can turn the tide of battle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find &quot;Ideas&quot; with their unique effects.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/e4673c700e59350c744c182cac2006f0.poster.avif?t=1754834036\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/e4673c700e59350c744c182cac2006f0.webm?t=1754834036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/e4673c700e59350c744c182cac2006f0.mp4?t=1754834036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayability - procedural generation and a vast amount of content (Over 200 creatures, 120+ spells, and around 300 &quot;Ideas&quot;) make each run unique. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lots of unlockable content.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Twitch integration, allowing interaction with the chat.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/a27a6c17a0503e0eac4299fad532a84e.poster.avif?t=1754834036\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/a27a6c17a0503e0eac4299fad532a84e.webm?t=1754834036\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2345740/extras/a27a6c17a0503e0eac4299fad532a84e.mp4?t=1754834036\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p></li></ul>",
